flowchart LR
  M[Markdown file] --> C[content-parser, the active task_store loader]
  C --> T[Legacy task shape]
  T --> P[Board projection]
  M --> D[Lossless Markdown Document]
  D --> F[Raw frontmatter preserved]
  D --> B[Body preserved]
  D -. planned .-> K[Kanban projection]
  K -. planned .-> T
  D --> X[Flat document-process profile]
  X --> E[Contained EDN sidecar]
  E --> V[Katamorph Malli validation]
  V --> Q[Typed proposal or rejection event]
  Q -. future interpreter .-> R[Workflow reactions]
